#. ~ Description of MOD "Berserk"
#: modinfo.json
msgid ""
"Adds content inspired by Kentaro Miura's Berserk. Face beings tied to the "
"God Hand, battle legendary demons, or forge and wield Guts' legendary sword."
msgstr "加入传奇作品《剑风传奇》（Berserk）的内容。探索黑暗之手的魔物，与传奇使徒交锋，或锻造并挥舞格斯之剑。"

#. ~ Profession name
#: professions/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Berserker"
msgstr "狂战士"

#. ~ Profession name
#: professions/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Berserker"
msgstr "狂战士"

#. ~ Profession description
#: professions/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid "You are a brute forged in a world-sized meat grinder, where zombies are little more than an excuse to exercise your fists and enormous sword. Illiterate but brutally capable, you cut down the dead like firewood. Now you wear cursed armor that steadily takes hold of your mind. How did you get here? It hardly matters—in this hell, strength is your ticket to another day."
msgstr "你是在这血肉磨坊里锻打出来的狠人——丧尸不过是活动靶子，正好让你挥挥拳头、抡抡巨剑。你不识字，但双手砍起活死人来像劈柴。你穿上了那套诅咒盔甲，它正一点点侵蚀你的心智。你怎么到这来的？说不清。但在这地狱里，力气就是你活到明天的通行证。"

#. ~ Profession description
#: professions/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid "You are a brute forged in a world-sized meat grinder, where zombies are little more than an excuse to exercise your fists and enormous sword. Illiterate but brutally capable, you cut down the dead like firewood. Now you wear cursed armor that steadily takes hold of your mind. How did you get here? It hardly matters—in this hell, strength is your ticket to another day."
msgstr "你是在这血肉磨坊里锻打出来的狠人——丧尸不过是活动靶子，正好让你挥挥拳头、抡抡巨剑。你不识字，但双手砍起活死人来像劈柴。你穿上了那套诅咒盔甲，它正一点点侵蚀你的心智。你怎么到这来的？说不清。但在这地狱里，力气就是你活到明天的通行证。"

#. ~ Profession name
#: professions/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Berserk Fan"
msgstr "剑风传奇粉丝"

#. ~ Profession name
#: professions/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Berserk Fan"
msgstr "剑风传奇粉丝"

#. ~ Profession description
#: professions/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You reread every volume of Berserk while zombies hammered on your apartment "
"door and decided: 'If Guts could do it, so can I!' You may lack his "
"strength, but you have a homemade copy of his sword, a stylish hoodie, and a"
" bandana—everything you need to look the part. In this apocalypse you have a"
" DREAM, even if you do not have much of a chance. Perhaps one day you too "
"will be free."
msgstr ""
"丧尸撞门的时候，你把《剑风传奇》又翻了一遍，然后认定：「格斯能行，我也能！」力气嘛……大概还差点。好在你有把仿制的巨剑，还有连帽衫和头巾——扮酷刚好够用。在这场末日的戏里，你是带着梦想的粉丝，至于能不能像格斯那样自由……那是以后的事。"

