#: effects/curse_effects.json
msgid "Berserker curse: quiet"
msgstr "狂战士铠甲的诅咒：平静"

#: effects/curse_effects.json
msgid "The armor's influence is still faint.  Remove all pieces to let it fade; resting without the armor speeds recovery."
msgstr "铠甲的影响还很微弱。脱下整套铠甲可让它逐渐消退；不穿铠甲休息能更快恢复。"

#: effects/curse_effects.json
msgid "Berserker curse: whispers"
msgstr "狂战士铠甲的诅咒：低语"

#: effects/curse_effects.json
msgid "The armor's whispers grow louder.  Remove all pieces to recover; resting without the armor is faster."
msgstr "铠甲的低语越来越响。脱下整套铠甲可逐渐恢复；不穿铠甲休息会更快。"

#: effects/curse_effects.json
msgid "Berserker curse: visions"
msgstr "狂战士铠甲的诅咒：幻象"

#: effects/curse_effects.json
msgid "Unsettling visions distract you.  Perception -1.  Remove all pieces to recover; resting without the armor is faster."
msgstr "令人不安的幻象分散你的注意力。感知 -1。脱下整套铠甲可逐渐恢复；不穿铠甲休息会更快。"

#: effects/curse_effects.json
msgid "Berserker curse: breaking point"
msgstr "狂战士铠甲的诅咒：崩溃边缘"

#: effects/curse_effects.json
msgid "The armor's influence overwhelms your senses.  Perception -2.  Remove all pieces to recover; resting without the armor is faster."
msgstr "铠甲的影响压倒了你的感官。感知 -2。脱下整套铠甲可逐渐恢复；不穿铠甲休息会更快。"

#: effects/curse_eocs.json
msgid "The armor's influence finally fades."
msgstr "铠甲的影响终于消退了。"

#: effects/curse_eocs.json
msgid "The armor's influence remains faint."
msgstr "铠甲的影响仍然微弱。"

#: effects/curse_eocs.json
msgid "Whispers press against your thoughts."
msgstr "低语不断萦绕在你的思绪间。"

#: effects/curse_eocs.json
msgid "Disturbing visions cloud your thoughts."
msgstr "令人不安的幻象模糊了你的思绪。"

#: effects/curse_eocs.json
msgid "The armor nearly overwhelms your mind!"
msgstr "铠甲几乎控制了你的心智！"

#: bionics/arm_cannon.json
msgid "Lost left hand"
msgstr "失去的左手"

#: bionics/arm_cannon.json
msgid "Your left hand is gone. This permanent interface anchors a prosthetic arm cannon; it cannot grip objects or help wield a weapon with both hands. You learn the recipes for 'prosthetic arm cannon CBM' and 'arm cannon charge'. Craft the cannon and activate it from your inventory to attach it yourself, without power or surgery."
msgstr "你的左手已经失去。这套永久接口可固定机械臂炮，但无法抓握物品或帮你双手持武器。你会学到“机械臂炮CBM”和“臂炮火药弹”的配方。制作臂炮后，在物品栏中激活它，即可自行安装，无需电力或手术。"

#: bionics/arm_cannon.json
msgid "Removing this interface cannot restore the missing hand."
msgstr "拆除这套接口无法恢复失去的手。"

#: bionics/arm_cannon.json
msgid "Prosthetic arm cannon"
msgstr "机械臂炮"

#: bionics/arm_cannon.json
msgid "A mechanical cannon mounted on the left arm after activating the crafted 'prosthetic arm cannon CBM' in your inventory. Activate this bionic to wield and reload its single chamber, then retract it to take up your sword again. It burns powder charges instead of bionic power."
msgstr "装在左臂上的机械臂炮。在物品栏中激活制作好的“机械臂炮CBM”即可安装。激活这项义体可展开并装填单发炮膛；需要持剑时可以将它收起。它使用火药弹药，不消耗义体能量。"

#: items/bionics/arm_cannon_cbms.json
msgid "lost left hand interface CBM"
msgstr "失去左手接口CBM"

#: items/bionics/arm_cannon_cbms.json
msgid "An interface left behind after the hand is lost. It cannot restore your grip, but provides a mount for a prosthetic cannon. Installing it teaches the recipes for 'prosthetic arm cannon CBM' and 'arm cannon charge'. Activate the crafted cannon from your inventory to attach it yourself, without power or surgery."
msgstr "失去手掌后留下的接口。它无法恢复抓握能力，却能固定机械臂炮。安装后，你会学到“机械臂炮CBM”和“臂炮火药弹”的配方。在物品栏中激活制作好的臂炮，即可自行安装，无需电力或手术。"

#: items/bionics/arm_cannon_cbms.json
msgid "prosthetic arm cannon CBM"
msgstr "机械臂炮CBM"

#: items/bionics/arm_cannon_cbms.json
msgid "A handmade mechanical arm cannon. With the lost left-hand interface installed, activate this item from your inventory to attach it yourself. No power, surgical equipment, or other materials are required. The item is consumed when the prosthetic arm cannon bionic is installed."
msgstr "手工制作的机械臂炮。装好失去左手的接口后，在物品栏中激活此物品即可自行安装。无需电力、手术设备或其他材料。安装机械臂炮义体后，该物品会被消耗。"

#: items/guns/arm_cannon.json
msgid "prosthetic arm cannon"
msgstr "机械臂炮"

#: items/guns/arm_cannon.json
msgid "An integrated single-shot cannon fitted to the left arm.  Reload it with a powder charge and retract it when you need your sword."
msgstr "安装在左臂的单发臂炮。用火药弹装填；需要握剑时可将其收起。"

#: items/ammo/arm_cannon_charge.json
msgid "arm cannon charge"
msgstr "臂炮火药弹"

#: items/ammo/arm_cannon_charge.json
msgid "A single heavy projectile and black powder charge prepared for the prosthetic arm cannon."
msgstr "为机械臂炮准备的单发重型弹丸与黑火药。"

#: professions/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Berserker with a lost hand"
msgstr "失去左手的狂战士"

#: professions/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Berserker with a lost hand"
msgstr "失去左手的狂战士"

#: professions/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid "Your left hand is gone.  The interface on its stump can support a cannon once you forge and install one.  Until then, your remaining hand and true sword must carry you through the Cataclysm."
msgstr "你的左手已经失去。等你打造并安装臂炮之后，断肢上的接口就能承载它。在那之前，只能靠剩下的一只手与真剑在灾变中求生。"

#: professions/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid "Your left hand is gone.  The interface on its stump can support a cannon once you forge and install one.  Until then, your remaining hand and true sword must carry you through the Cataclysm."
msgstr "你的左手已经失去。等你打造并安装臂炮之后，断肢上的接口就能承载它。在那之前，只能靠剩下的一只手与真剑在灾变中求生。"

#: scenarios/berserk_lost_hand_start.json
msgctxt "scenario_male"
msgid "(BERSERK) The Lost Hand"
msgstr "【剑风传奇】失去的左手"

#: scenarios/berserk_lost_hand_start.json
msgctxt "scenario_female"
msgid "(BERSERK) The Lost Hand"
msgstr "【剑风传奇】失去的左手"

#: scenarios/berserk_lost_hand_start.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid "You survived the loss of your left hand.  The interface left behind can hold an arm cannon once you forge one.  For now, you have your remaining hand, your sword and the road ahead."
msgstr "你失去了左手，却活了下来。留在断肢上的接口可以安装你将来打造的臂炮。眼下，你只有另一只手、剑和前方的路。"

#: scenarios/berserk_lost_hand_start.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid "You survived the loss of your left hand.  The interface left behind can hold an arm cannon once you forge one.  For now, you have your remaining hand, your sword and the road ahead."
msgstr "你失去了左手，却活了下来。留在断肢上的接口可以安装你将来打造的臂炮。眼下，你只有另一只手、剑和前方的路。"

#: scenarios/berserk_lost_hand_start.json
msgctxt "start_name"
msgid "On the road"
msgstr "路上"

#: effects/berserk_mode_effects.json
msgid "Berserk mode"
msgstr "狂战士模式"

#: effects/berserk_mode_effects.json
msgid "The armor drives you past exhaustion.  Strength +2, speed +10, and enough stamina to keep moving and fighting."
msgstr "铠甲迫使你突破疲惫继续战斗。力量 +2，速度 +10，并维持足以移动和作战的体力。"

#: effects/berserk_mode_effects.json
msgid "Berserk mode recovery"
msgstr "狂战士模式恢复期"

#: effects/berserk_mode_effects.json
msgid "The armor has drained you.  Strength -2 and speed -15.  You cannot enter Berserk mode again until this effect ends and the curse subsides."
msgstr "铠甲已耗尽你的力量。力量 −2，速度 −15。在恢复结束且诅咒减弱前，无法再次进入狂战士模式。"

#: effects/berserk_mode_eocs.json
msgid "The armor takes control! Berserk mode: 150 seconds. When it ends, your stamina will empty and you will lose a great deal of blood. Prepare an escape now!"
msgstr "铠甲夺取了控制权！狂战士模式：150 秒。结束时体力会耗尽，你也会失去大量血液。现在就准备退路！"

#: effects/berserk_mode_eocs.json
msgid "The rage ends. You collapse into exhaustion as your blood volume falls."
msgstr "狂怒结束了。你精疲力尽，血容量也骤然下降。"

#: effects/berserk_mode_eocs.json
msgid "Berserk mode: 1 second remaining."
msgstr "狂战士模式：还剩 1 秒。"

