#: items/armor_berserk/berserk_armor_bundle.json
msgid "packed Berserker armor"
msgstr "打包的狂战士铠甲"

#: items/armor_berserk/berserk_armor_bundle.json
msgid "All six pieces of Berserker armor fastened together for carrying.  Disassemble this bundle to recover the helmet, chestplate, gloves, armguards, legguards and boots before wearing them.  Packing and unpacking do not cleanse the armor's curse."
msgstr "六件狂战士铠甲绑在一起，便于携带。穿戴前拆开套装，取出头盔、胸甲、手套、臂甲、腿甲和靴子。打包和拆包都不会解除铠甲的诅咒。"

#: effects/arm_cannon_recipe_eoc.json
msgid "You learn 'prosthetic arm cannon CBM' and 'arm cannon charge'. Craft the cannon, then activate the item from your inventory to attach it."
msgstr "你学会了“机械臂炮CBM”和“臂炮火药弹”的配方。制作臂炮后，在物品栏中激活它即可安装。"

#: items/behelit.json
msgid "Behelit"
msgstr "贝赫莱特"

#: items/behelit.json
msgid "A small, unsettling stone with features that never seem to stay in place.  For now, activating it opens a test passage into the Eclipse; activate it there or examine the return seal to come back.  The full Eclipse encounter is not yet implemented."
msgstr "一块令人不安的小石头，表面的五官似乎不断变化。目前激活它可以进入日蚀测试区域；在里面再次激活，或查看返回印记，即可回到原处。完整的日蚀事件尚未实现。"

#: items/behelit.json
msgid "Activate Behelit"
msgstr "激活贝赫莱特"

#: overmap/eclipse_trial.json
msgid "Eclipse (test area)"
msgstr "日蚀（测试区域）"

#: furniture/eclipse_trial.json
msgid "Eclipse return seal"
msgstr "日蚀返回印记"

#: furniture/eclipse_trial.json
msgid "An inert mark on the floor.  Examine it to return to the place where you activated the Behelit."
msgstr "地面上的一道静止印记。查看它即可返回激活贝赫莱特的地方。"

#: effects/eclipse_trial_eocs.json
msgid "Enter the Eclipse test area?  Only your carried equipment will follow you.  Activate the Behelit or examine the return seal to leave."
msgstr "进入日蚀测试区域吗？只有随身携带的物品会与你一同传送。激活贝赫莱特或查看返回印记即可离开。"

#: effects/eclipse_trial_eocs.json
msgid "The Behelit draws you into a silent chamber of living flesh."
msgstr "贝赫莱特将你拉入一间由活体血肉构成的寂静房间。"

#: effects/eclipse_trial_eocs.json
msgid "The passage does not open.  You remain where you are."
msgstr "通道未能开启。你仍留在原地。"

#: effects/eclipse_trial_eocs.json
msgid "The Behelit cannot find a safe passage.  Nothing happens."
msgstr "贝赫莱特找不到安全的通道。什么都没有发生。"

#: effects/eclipse_trial_eocs.json
msgid "No place of return is recorded for you."
msgstr "没有记录你的返回地点。"

#: effects/eclipse_trial_eocs.json
msgid "Return to the place where you activated the Behelit?  Leave anything on the ground behind."
msgstr "返回激活贝赫莱特的地方吗？留在地上的物品不会随你返回。"

#: effects/eclipse_trial_eocs.json
msgid "The Eclipse recedes.  You return to the world you left."
msgstr "日蚀逐渐退去。你回到了来时的世界。"

#: effects/eclipse_trial_eocs.json
msgid "The return passage is blocked.  Try again from the seal."
msgstr "返回通道被堵住了。请从印记处重试。"

#: effects/eclipse_rescue_eocs.json
msgid "The Skull Knight's escape route is blocked. Use the Behelit to leave; the rescue will finish once you return."
msgstr "骷髅骑士的逃生通道被堵住了。请使用贝赫莱特离开；返回后救援便会完成。"

#: effects/eclipse_state_eocs.json
msgid "The Skull Knight tears you free of the Eclipse. Your left hand is gone, but you have survived. You know how to build a prosthetic arm cannon and its charge. A new era begins."
msgstr "骷髅骑士将你从日蚀中救出。你失去了左手，但活了下来。你现在知道如何制作义肢臂炮植入体及其弹药。一个新时代开始了。"

#: effects/eclipse_rescue_eocs.json
msgid "Your strength fails. As the Eclipse closes in, a blade cuts through the darkness. The Skull Knight appears between you and the abyss."
msgstr "你的力量耗尽了。蚀的黑暗步步逼近，一道剑光劈开黑暗。骷髅骑士挡在你与深渊之间。"

#: effects/eclipse_rescue_eocs.json
msgid "The Skull Knight opens a path through the Eclipse. 'Hold on. We leave now.'"
msgstr "骷髅骑士在蚀中劈开一条道路。“撑住。我们现在离开。”"

#: effects/eclipse_aftermath_eocs.json
msgid "The Skull Knight has brought you back. Your left hand and an eye are gone. The Brand of Sacrifice burns on your body. You can now craft the prosthetic arm cannon and its charge. Activate the crafted cannon from your inventory to attach it yourself."
msgstr "骷髅骑士把你带了回来。你的左手和一只眼睛没了。祭品烙印灼烧着你的身体。你现在可以制作义肢手炮及其弹药。在物品栏中激活制作好的臂炮，即可自行安装。"

#: monsters/skull_knight_rescuer.json
msgid "The Skull Knight who pulled you from the Eclipse. He will speak with you, but will not turn his sword on you or your allies."
msgstr "将你从蚀中救出的骷髅骑士。他愿意与你交谈，也不会对你或你的盟友挥剑。"

#: dialogue/skull_knight.json
msgid "'The Eclipse has not claimed you yet. I will cut a way out. Stay close.' Beyond his shoulder, the darkness recoils from his blade."
msgstr "“蚀还没有夺走你。我会劈开一条路。跟紧我。”在他的身后，黑暗被剑刃逼退。"

#: dialogue/skull_knight.json
msgid "What is happening?"
msgstr "发生了什么？"

#: dialogue/skull_knight.json
msgid "Get me out of here."
msgstr "带我离开这里。"

#: dialogue/skull_knight.json
msgid "'Survive first. Answers can wait.' He raises his sword, and a path opens through the dark."
msgstr "“先活下去。答案可以等等。”他举起剑，黑暗中裂开一条道路。"

#: dialogue/skull_knight.json
msgid "Follow the Skull Knight."
msgstr "跟随骷髅骑士。"

#: dialogue/skull_knight.json
msgid "'You escaped, but the Eclipse has marked you. Your hand is gone. What comes next is yours to decide.'"
msgstr "“你逃出来了，但蚀在你身上留下了印记。你的手已经没了。接下来怎么走，由你自己决定。”"

#: dialogue/skull_knight.json
msgid "How can I replace my hand?"
msgstr "我该怎么替换我的手？"

#: dialogue/skull_knight.json
msgid "I need to go."
msgstr "我该走了。"

#: dialogue/skull_knight.json
msgid "'Craft the prosthetic arm cannon and its charge. Once the cannon is made, activate it from your inventory. The mount where your left hand used to be will hold it.'"
msgstr "“制作机械臂炮和弹药。完成后，在物品栏中激活臂炮。失去左手后留下的接口会将它固定住。”"

#: dialogue/skull_knight.json
msgid "I understand."
msgstr "我明白了。"

#: monsters/eclipse_demons.json
msgid "Eclipse wretch"
msgstr "蚀之孽物"

#: monsters/eclipse_demons.json
msgid "A gaunt shape of torn skin and exposed teeth, the first creature to crawl out after the Eclipse. It rushes its prey in a pack, relying on numbers rather than strength."
msgstr "瘦骨嶙峋的怪物，皮肤撕裂，獠牙外露，是蚀之刻后最早爬出的邪物之一。它们成群扑向猎物，靠数量而非力量取胜。"

#: monsters/eclipse_demons.json
msgid "Eclipse half-demon"
msgstr "蚀之半魔"

#: monsters/eclipse_demons.json
msgid "Human proportions remain beneath swollen flesh and a crooked jaw. This half-demon lunges across the last few steps before its victim can retreat."
msgstr "肿胀的血肉和歪斜的下颚下仍依稀可见人形。这个半恶魔会猛扑过最后几步，不给猎物后退的机会。"

#: monsters/eclipse_demons.json
msgid "Eclipse hunter"
msgstr "蚀之猎手"

#: monsters/eclipse_demons.json
msgid "Too thin for its height, with long limbs and sharpened nails. It moves faster than its kin and darts at anyone who leaves a gap in their guard."
msgstr "身形高瘦得不成比例，四肢修长，指甲锋利。它比同类更快，专扑防守露出破绽的猎物。"

#: monsters/eclipse_demons.json
msgid "Eclipse butcher"
msgstr "蚀之屠夫"

#: monsters/eclipse_demons.json
msgid "A hulking mass of knotted muscle drags its heavy arms through the ruins. It is slow and easy to evade, but a direct blow can break through light armor."
msgstr "一座肌肉虬结的肉山拖着沉重的双臂穿过废墟。它动作迟缓，容易躲开，但正面一击足以击穿轻甲。"

#: monsters/eclipse_demons.json
msgid "Eclipse executioner"
msgstr "蚀之刽子手"

#: monsters/eclipse_demons.json
msgid "An executioner from the depths of the Eclipse, armored in hardened flesh. It raises its blade before a devastating cleave; that brief warning is the last chance to step away."
msgstr "来自蚀之刻深处的刽子手，身披硬化血肉。它会先举起刀刃，再发动毁灭性的劈砍；那短暂的预兆是最后的躲避机会。"

#: monsters/eclipse_demons.json
msgid "The executioner brings its blade down on you!"
msgstr "刽子手的刀刃向你劈下！"

#: monsters/eclipse_demons.json
msgid "The executioner brings its blade down on %s!"
msgstr "刽子手的刀刃向%s劈下！"

#: monsters/eclipse_demons.json
msgid "You slip away from the executioner's heavy strike!"
msgstr "你躲开了刽子手的重击！"

#: monsters/eclipse_demons.json
msgid "%s slips away from the executioner's heavy strike!"
msgstr "%s躲开了刽子手的重击！"

#: monsters/eclipse_demons.json
msgid "The executioner raises its blade for a crushing strike!"
msgstr "刽子手举起刀刃，准备发动毁灭性的一击！"

#: effects/eclipse_combat_effects.json
msgid "Preparing a cleave"
msgstr "蓄势劈砍"

#: effects/eclipse_combat_effects.json
msgid "This creature is winding up for a heavy blow."
msgstr "这个生物正准备发动重击。"

#: items/eclipse_fallen_band.json
msgid "Judeau's body"
msgstr "捷度的遗体"

#: items/eclipse_fallen_band.json
msgid "Judeau lies motionless among the remains of the Band of the Hawk. His throwing knives are still close by."
msgstr "捷度一动不动地躺在鹰之团的遗骸之间。他的飞刀还散落在身旁。"

#: items/eclipse_fallen_band.json
msgid "Pippin's body"
msgstr "比宾的遗体"

#: items/eclipse_fallen_band.json
msgid "Pippin fell holding the passage. His great hammer lies within reach."
msgstr "比宾在守住通道时倒下。他的重锤就落在触手可及的地方。"

#: items/eclipse_fallen_band.json
msgid "Corkus's body"
msgstr "哥尔卡斯的遗体"

#: items/eclipse_fallen_band.json
msgid "Corkus did not escape the Eclipse. A slender blade lies beside him."
msgstr "哥尔卡斯没能逃出蚀。一柄细长的剑躺在他身旁。"

#: items/eclipse_fallen_band.json
msgid "Gaston's body"
msgstr "加斯顿的遗体"

#: items/eclipse_fallen_band.json
msgid "Gaston lies beneath a worn steel breastplate, far from the others."
msgstr "加斯顿身穿磨损的钢制胸甲，倒在远离其他人的地方。"

#: monsters/griffith_eclipse.json
msgid "Griffith of the Eclipse"
msgstr "蚀之格里菲斯"

#: monsters/griffith_eclipse.json
msgid "Griffith waits at the heart of the Eclipse. His familiar silhouette is surrounded by the remains of a world that should not exist."
msgstr "格里菲斯在蚀的中心等待着。熟悉的身影周围，是一个本不该存在的世界的残骸。"

#: effects/eclipse_victory_eocs.json
msgid "Griffith falls. The Eclipse shudders, but does not release you. The Skull Knight cuts a path through the closing darkness."
msgstr "格里菲斯倒下了。蚀为之震颤，却依然没有放过你。骷髅骑士在合拢的黑暗中劈开一条道路。"

#: dialogue/skull_knight.json
msgid "'You brought him down. Even so, this place will devour what remains of you. Come with me, now.'"
msgstr "“你打倒了他。但这地方仍会吞噬你剩下的一切。现在跟我走。”"

#: dialogue/skull_knight.json
msgid "Follow the Skull Knight out of the Eclipse."
msgstr "跟随骷髅骑士离开蚀。"

#: items/behelit.json
msgid "A small, unsettling stone with features that never seem to stay in place. Activating it opens a passage into the Eclipse. Activate it there or examine the return seal to come back."
msgstr "一块令人不安的小石头，五官似乎不停变化。激活它会打开通往蚀的道路。要返回，那里再次激活它或查看返回印记。"

#: effects/eclipse_trial_eocs.json
msgid "Enter the Eclipse? Only your carried equipment will follow you. Activate the Behelit or examine the return seal to leave."
msgstr "要进入蚀吗？只有随身携带的装备会与你一同前往。激活贝赫莱特或查看返回印记即可离开。"

#: overmap/eclipse_dungeon.json
msgid "Eclipse"
msgstr "蚀"

#: effects/eclipse_trial_eocs.json
msgid "The Behelit has gone quiet. The Eclipse has ended for you."
msgstr "贝赫莱特沉寂了。对你而言，蚀已结束。"

#: bionics/eclipse_marks.json
msgid "Brand of Sacrifice"
msgstr "祭品烙印"

#: bionics/eclipse_marks.json
msgid "The mark left by the Eclipse. After dark it draws real demons toward you. It aches when demons gather and warns of a powerful presence nearby, without revealing its identity or direction."
msgstr "蚀之刻留下的烙印。入夜后，它会将真正的恶魔引向你。恶魔聚集时会隐隐作痛，也会对附近的强大存在发出警示，但不会指出其身份或方向。"

#: bionics/eclipse_marks.json
msgid "The Brand of Sacrifice is seared into your body."
msgstr "祭品烙印已烙入你的身体。"

#: bionics/eclipse_marks.json
msgid "Lost eye"
msgstr "失去一只眼睛"

#: bionics/eclipse_marks.json
msgid "An eye was lost during the Eclipse. Your Perception is halved."
msgstr "你在蚀之刻失去了一只眼睛。感知减半。"

#: bionics/eclipse_marks.json
msgid "Removing a record of the wound would not restore the lost eye."
msgstr "抹去伤痕记录也无法让失去的眼睛复原。"

#: effects/eclipse_brand_eocs.json
msgid "The Brand of Sacrifice stings. Demons are gathering nearby."
msgstr "祭品烙印阵阵刺痛。恶魔正在附近聚集。"

#: effects/eclipse_brand_eocs.json
msgid "The Brand of Sacrifice burns. A terrifying presence is somewhere nearby."
msgstr "祭品烙印灼痛难忍。附近有一股可怖的气息。"

#: effects/brand_cooldowns.json
msgid "Brand of Sacrifice: warning fading"
msgstr "祭品烙印：警兆渐息"

#: effects/brand_cooldowns.json
msgid "The brand has recently warned you of nearby demons."
msgstr "烙印刚刚警示过附近的恶魔。"

#: effects/brand_cooldowns.json
msgid "Brand of Sacrifice: ominous warning fading"
msgstr "祭品烙印：凶兆渐息"

#: effects/brand_cooldowns.json
msgid "The brand has recently sensed a powerful nearby presence."
msgstr "烙印刚刚感知到附近的强大存在。"

#: items/bionics/arm_cannon_cbms.json
msgid "Attach arm cannon"
msgstr "装上机械臂炮"

#: effects/arm_cannon_install_eocs.json
msgid "You attach the arm cannon to your missing left hand. Activate the new bionic to deploy it."
msgstr "你把机械臂炮装在失去的左手处。激活新的义体即可展开臂炮。"

#: effects/arm_cannon_install_eocs.json
msgid "The cannon has nowhere to attach. Your left hand must be missing."
msgstr "臂炮没有可以固定的接口。你必须先失去左手。"

#: effects/arm_cannon_install_eocs.json
msgid "You already have an arm cannon installed."
msgstr "你已经装有机械臂炮。"

#: effects/arm_cannon_install_eocs.json
msgid "Keep the crafted arm cannon in your inventory to attach it."
msgstr "将制作好的机械臂炮放在物品栏中，才能安装。"

#: monsters/apostle_projections.json
msgid "Projection of Zodd"
msgid_plural "Projections of Zodd"
msgstr[0] "佐德的投影"

#: monsters/apostle_projections.json
msgid "Reflection of Griffith"
msgid_plural "Reflections of Griffith"
msgstr[0] "格里菲斯的映像"

#: monsters/apostle_projections.json
msgid "Reflection of Void"
msgid_plural "Reflections of Void"
msgstr[0] "沃伊德的映像"

#: monsters/apostle_projections.json
msgid "A scarred silhouette shaped like Nosferatu Zodd. Its blows are real, but the creature itself is only a fragment drawn into this world around a Behelit."
msgstr "一道形似诺斯费拉图·佐德、满身伤痕的轮廓。它的攻击确实会伤人，但它本身只是围绕贝黑莱特降临此世的一道碎影。"

#: monsters/apostle_projections.json
msgid "A winged reflection of Griffith, drawn into the world around a Behelit. Destroying this apparition does not kill the being whose image it bears."
msgstr "格里菲斯的有翼映像，因贝黑莱特而降临此世。摧毁这道幻影，并不会杀死它所映照的本尊。"

#: monsters/apostle_projections.json
msgid "Void's likeness looms from a breach in reality. This dangerous reflection gathered around a Behelit, but its destruction cannot reach the original."
msgstr "沃伊德的形貌从现实的裂隙中浮现。这道危险的映像因贝黑莱特而凝聚，毁掉它也无法伤及本尊。"

#: monsters/apostle_projections.json
msgid "The %s unravels, leaving a Behelit behind."
msgstr "%s逐渐消散，留下了一枚贝黑莱特。"

#: effects_on_condition.json
msgid "A reflection of Griffith appears in a flare of dark power!"
msgstr "一阵黑暗力量闪过，格里菲斯的映像出现了！"

#: overmap/behelit_sites.json
msgid "cursed oak"
msgstr "проклятый дуб"

#: overmap/behelit_sites.json
msgid "echo cave"
msgstr "回声洞窟"

#: overmap/behelit_sites.json
msgid "echo cave depth"
msgstr "回声洞窟深处"

#: monsters/behelit_site_guardians.json
msgid "cursed oak demon"
msgid_plural "cursed oak demons"
msgstr[0] "诅咒橡树恶魔"

#: monsters/behelit_site_guardians.json
msgid "echo cave demon"
msgid_plural "echo cave demons"
msgstr[0] "回声洞窟恶魔"

#: monsters/behelit_site_guardians.json
msgid "An oak that learned to wear a predator's face. Its split bark hides teeth and a burning eye; roots tear free of the soil when it reaches for the living. It guards the Behelit among its roots."
msgstr "一棵学会披上掠食者面孔的橡树。裂开的树皮里藏着利齿和燃烧的眼睛；当它伸向活人时，树根会破土而出。它守护着根间的贝黑莱特。"

#: monsters/behelit_site_guardians.json
msgid "A hunched mass of bone and torn flesh that listens to footsteps in the dark. Its many joints let it lunge around stone pillars. A Behelit rests deeper inside its lair."
msgstr "一团佝偻的骨骸与裂肉，在黑暗中倾听脚步。它关节众多，能够绕过石柱猛扑。贝黑莱特藏在巢穴更深处。"

#: furniture/behelit_sites.json
msgid "Behelit among the roots"
msgstr "树根间的贝黑莱特"

#: furniture/behelit_sites.json
msgid "A stone face is knotted into the old oak's roots. Examine it when the guardian cannot reach you."
msgstr "石头面孔缠在老橡树的根间。等守卫无法触及你时，再仔细查看。"

#: furniture/behelit_sites.json
msgid "empty oak roots"
msgstr "空荡的橡树根"

#: furniture/behelit_sites.json
msgid "The Behelit is gone. The old roots now hold only stones and dried blood."
msgstr "贝黑莱特已经不见了。老树根间只剩石块与干涸的血迹。"

#: furniture/behelit_sites.json
msgid "Behelit in the stone hollow"
msgstr "石穴中的贝黑莱特"

#: furniture/behelit_sites.json
msgid "A Behelit lies in a hollow at the center of the cave. Examine it when its keeper is away."
msgstr "贝黑莱特 леж在洞窟中央的石穴中。等守卫离开时再仔细查看。"

#: furniture/behelit_sites.json
msgid "empty stone hollow"
msgstr "空荡的石穴"

#: furniture/behelit_sites.json
msgid "The hollow has already yielded its Behelit."
msgstr "石穴中的贝黑莱特已经被取走了。"

#: monster_special_attacks/behelit_site_attacks.json
msgid "The oak demon catches you with a lashing root!"
msgstr "橡树恶魔的树根抽中了你！"

#: monster_special_attacks/behelit_site_attacks.json
msgid "The oak demon catches %s with a lashing root!"
msgstr "橡树恶魔的树根抽中了%s！"

#: monster_special_attacks/behelit_site_attacks.json
msgid "The oak demon's root lashes past you!"
msgstr "橡树恶魔的树根从你身边抽过！"

#: monster_special_attacks/behelit_site_attacks.json
msgid "The oak demon's root lashes past %s!"
msgstr "橡树恶魔的树根从%s身边抽过！"

#: monster_special_attacks/behelit_site_attacks.json
msgid "The cave demon lunges and tears at you!"
msgstr "洞窟恶魔扑向你，撕扯你的血肉！"

#: monster_special_attacks/behelit_site_attacks.json
msgid "The cave demon lunges and tears at %s!"
msgstr "洞窟恶魔扑向%s，撕扯血肉！"

#: monster_special_attacks/behelit_site_attacks.json
msgid "The cave demon lunges past you!"
msgstr "洞窟恶魔从你身边扑过！"

#: monster_special_attacks/behelit_site_attacks.json
msgid "The cave demon lunges past %s!"
msgstr "洞窟恶魔从%s身边扑过！"

#: effects/behelit_site_eocs.json
msgid "You wrench the Behelit from the roots. The oak's grasp cannot reach you here."
msgstr "你从树根间夺走贝黑莱特。橡树的爪根此刻够不到你。"

#: effects/behelit_site_eocs.json
msgid "The oak demon's roots tighten around the Behelit. Drive it away or lure it from the hollow."
msgstr "橡树恶魔的树根缠紧了贝黑莱特。击败它，或把它引离树穴。"

#: effects/behelit_site_eocs.json
msgid "You take the Behelit from the stone hollow while its keeper is gone."
msgstr "趁守卫不在，你从石穴中取走贝黑莱特。"

#: effects/behelit_site_eocs.json
msgid "The cave demon hears your movement near the hollow. Draw it away or kill it first."
msgstr "洞窟恶魔听见你在石穴旁的动静。引开它，或先杀死它。"

#: furniture/behelit_sites.json
msgid "hanging bone chimes"
msgstr "悬挂的骨铃"

#: furniture/behelit_sites.json
msgid "A cord of bones hangs at the edge of the clearing. Examine it to make a distracting noise, then circle back toward the roots."
msgstr "空地边缘挂着一串骨头。拨动它制造响声，再绕回树根旁。"

#: furniture/behelit_sites.json
msgid "loose stone chime"
msgstr "松石响铃"

#: furniture/behelit_sites.json
msgid "Loose stones have been strung over a hollow at the back of the cave. Examine them to make a loud echo and draw the keeper away from its relic."
msgstr "洞窟深处的空穴上方吊着几块松石。拨动它们制造巨响，引开看守遗物的恶魔。"

#: effects/behelit_site_eocs.json
msgid "The bone chimes clatter through the trees!"
msgstr "骨铃的响声传遍树林！"

#: effects/behelit_site_eocs.json
msgid "The bone chimes rattle. Now is your chance to draw the oak demon away."
msgstr "骨铃响了。趁现在把橡树恶魔引开。"

#: effects/behelit_site_eocs.json
msgid "Stones crash and echo through the cave!"
msgstr "石块撞击的巨响在洞窟中回荡！"

#: effects/behelit_site_eocs.json
msgid "The stone chime rings through the cave. Use the pillars to circle behind the keeper."
msgstr "石铃在洞窟中响起。利用石柱绕到守卫身后。"

#: effects/eclipse_trial_eocs.json
msgid "Enter the Eclipse? Only your carried equipment will follow you. The Behelit will be consumed when the passage opens, and there is no path back until the final confrontation."
msgstr "进入蚀之刻？只有随身携带的装备会跟随你。通道开启时贝黑莱特会被消耗；在最终对决前无法返回。"

#: effects/eclipse_trial_eocs.json
msgid "The Behelit draws you onto a field of living flesh. Behind you, the passage seals shut."
msgstr "贝黑莱特将你拉进一片活生生的血肉之原。身后的通道随即封闭。"

#: effects/eclipse_trial_eocs.json
msgid "The passage behind you is gone. Only the final confrontation remains."
msgstr "身后的通道消失了。只剩下最终对决。"

#: effects/eclipse_trial_eocs.json
msgid "Return to the place where you activated the Behelit? Leave anything on the ground behind."
msgstr "返回你启动贝黑莱特的地点？留在地上的物品都会被遗弃。"

#: effects/eclipse_rescue_eocs.json
msgid "The Skull Knight's escape route is blocked. Reach the rift in the final field and try the passage again."
msgstr "骷髅骑士开辟的逃生道路被堵住了。前往终场的裂隙再试一次。"

#: effects/eclipse_field_scenes.json
msgid "Judeau fought to keep a path open for the others. Only his knives and a small hilt remain in the blood-soaked earth."
msgstr "捷度奋力为其他人守住退路。浸血的土地上只剩下他的飞刀和一截小小的刀柄。"

#: effects/eclipse_field_scenes.json
msgid "Pippin stood his ground when the line collapsed. The clasp from his armor is still caught beneath his hand."
msgstr "防线崩溃时，彼宾仍坚守原地。他的手下还压着一枚盔甲搭扣。"

#: effects/eclipse_field_scenes.json
msgid "Corkus ran toward a gap in the swarm. The path closed before he reached it."
msgstr "哥尔卡斯冲向魔群中的缺口，但还没赶到，退路就被堵死了。"

#: effects/eclipse_field_scenes.json
msgid "Gaston faced the center of the ceremony. Whatever he saw there stopped him in his tracks."
msgstr "加斯顿面朝仪式中心。他在那里看见的东西让他僵在原地。"

#: effects/eclipse_field_scenes.json
msgid "Someone abandoned a satchel of bandages and painkillers. A hunter circles nearby; taking them may cost more than a detour."
msgstr "有人丢下了一袋绷带和止痛药。猎手正在附近徘徊；取走补给也许比绕路更危险。"

#: effects/eclipse_field_scenes.json
msgid "These tracks split around the pits. One route winds wide and quiet; the shorter route leads past the hunter."
msgstr "脚印在坑洞旁分开。一条路迂回而安静；近路要经过猎手身边。"

#: effects/eclipse_field_scenes.json
msgid "The creatures are occupied with the dead. You can cross the open flank or challenge the cluster head-on."
msgstr "怪物正忙着啃食死者。你可以从开阔侧翼绕过，或正面挑战它们。"

#: effects/eclipse_field_scenes.json
msgid "The field grows still. Ahead lies Griffith and the end of the procession. Your way back vanished when the Behelit opened."
msgstr "旷野忽然安静。前方是格里菲斯，也是这场行进的终点。贝黑莱特开启时，你的退路就已消失。"

#: furniture/eclipse_trial.json
msgid "A mark left by an older passage. Examine it to return only if you entered before the passage began consuming Behelits."
msgstr "旧通道留下的印记。只有在通道开始消耗贝黑莱特之前进入的人，才能借此返回。"

#: furniture/eclipse_trial.json
msgid "sealed Eclipse passage"
msgstr "封闭的蚀之刻通道"

#: furniture/eclipse_trial.json
msgid "The Behelit has dissolved into this scar of flesh. There is no passage back."
msgstr "贝黑莱特已融入这道血肉伤痕。这里没有回头路。"

#: furniture/eclipse_trial.json
msgid "Skull Knight's escape rift"
msgstr "骷髅骑士的逃生裂隙"

#: furniture/eclipse_trial.json
msgid "A cut through the ceremony's darkness. After the Skull Knight intervenes, examine it if the return passage is blocked."
msgstr "仪式黑暗中的一道裂口。骷髅骑士出手后，若归途受阻，就检查这处裂隙。"

#: furniture/eclipse_trial.json
msgid "Judeau's remains"
msgstr "捷度的遗骸"

#: furniture/eclipse_trial.json
msgid "A quiet hand rests beside three spent knife sheaths. Examine the body to remember how he covered the retreat."
msgstr "一只静止的手旁躺着三只空刀鞘。检查遗体，回想他如何掩护众人撤退。"

#: furniture/eclipse_trial.json
msgid "Pippin's remains"
msgstr "彼宾的遗骸"

#: furniture/eclipse_trial.json
msgid "His body still lies between the fallen and the oncoming horror. Examine what he defended."
msgstr "他的身体仍横在死者与逼近的恐怖之间。看看他守护的地方。"

#: furniture/eclipse_trial.json
msgid "Corkus's remains"
msgstr "哥尔卡斯的遗骸"

#: furniture/eclipse_trial.json
msgid "A broken stance and a useless blade tell the end of his flight. Examine the scene."
msgstr "扭曲的姿势与无用的刀刃诉说着他逃亡的结局。检查现场。"

#: furniture/eclipse_trial.json
msgid "Gaston's remains"
msgstr "加斯顿的遗骸"

#: furniture/eclipse_trial.json
msgid "His battered breastplate is turned toward the final ceremony. Examine the body."
msgstr "他破损的胸甲朝向最后的仪式。检查遗体。"

#: furniture/eclipse_trial.json
msgid "broken field satchel"
msgstr "破损的野战挎包"

#: furniture/eclipse_trial.json
msgid "A torn satchel holds a few medical supplies. Something hunts near this exposed patch of ground."
msgstr "破损的挎包里还剩些医疗用品。某个东西正在这片暴露的空地附近狩猎。"

#: furniture/eclipse_trial.json
msgid "trampled escape trail"
msgstr "被践踏的逃生小径"

#: furniture/eclipse_trial.json
msgid "Tracks scatter around the pits and converge again beyond them. Examine the trail."
msgstr "足迹绕开坑洞，又在另一头汇合。检查这条小径。"

#: furniture/eclipse_trial.json
msgid "remains of a feast"
msgstr "盛宴的残迹"

#: furniture/eclipse_trial.json
msgid "The demons have gathered around the fallen. Examine the site, or skirt the revelers."
msgstr "恶魔聚在死者身旁。检查现场，或绕过这群饕餮之徒。"

#: furniture/eclipse_trial.json
msgid "ceremonial scars"
msgstr "仪式伤痕"

#: furniture/eclipse_trial.json
msgid "Deep cuts in the living ground point toward the final gathering. Examine the scars."
msgstr "活着的大地上深深的割痕指向最后的集会。检查伤痕。"

#: furniture/eclipse_trial.json
msgid "living ground"
msgstr "活着的土地"

#: mapgen/eclipse_palettes.json
msgid "A vast expanse of yielding, scarred flesh stretches beneath the Eclipse."
msgstr "蚀之刻下方，大片柔软而伤痕累累的血肉延伸到视野尽头。"

#: mapgen/eclipse_palettes.json
msgid "ash-covered ground"
msgstr "覆灰的地面"

#: mapgen/eclipse_palettes.json
msgid "Ash clings to the living ground where the sacrificial crowd once stood. It is firm enough to cross."
msgstr "灰烬覆盖着祭品曾经聚集的活地面。这里仍能通行。"

#: mapgen/eclipse_palettes.json
msgid "trampled flesh"
msgstr "踩踏过的血肉"

#: mapgen/eclipse_palettes.json
msgid "A network of shallow scars marks the paths taken by fleeing survivors."
msgstr "浅浅的伤痕标记着幸存者逃离时走过的路线。"

#: mapgen/eclipse_palettes.json
msgid "dim vein"
msgstr "微光血脉"

#: mapgen/eclipse_palettes.json
msgid "A faint pulse of light travels beneath the ground. It barely illuminates the way ahead."
msgstr "微弱的光在地面下脉动，勉强照亮前方的路。"

#: mapgen/eclipse_palettes.json
msgid "flesh ridge"
msgstr "血肉隆脊"

#: mapgen/eclipse_palettes.json
msgid "Folded flesh rises into a solid ridge, hiding the field beyond it."
msgstr "层叠的血肉隆起成坚实的脊，遮住了另一侧的战场。"

#: items/eclipse_fallen_band.json
msgid "Judeau's knife hilt"
msgstr "捷度的刀柄"

#: items/eclipse_fallen_band.json
msgid "A worn knife hilt from the Band of the Hawk. Carry it when you speak to the Skull Knight about the Eclipse."
msgstr "鹰之团成员用过的磨损刀柄。若想向骷髅骑士询问蚀之刻，就随身带着它。"

#: items/eclipse_fallen_band.json
msgid "Pippin's broken clasp"
msgstr "彼宾断裂的搭扣"

#: items/eclipse_fallen_band.json
msgid "The last clasp from Pippin's battered armor. Carry it when you ask the Skull Knight about those left behind."
msgstr "彼宾残破盔甲上最后的一枚搭扣。若要向骷髅骑士询问那些被留下的人，就带着它。"

#: items/behelit.json
msgid "A small, unsettling stone with features that never seem to stay in place. A successful activation opens the Eclipse and consumes one Behelit. The way back closes; surviving the final confrontation is the only escape."
msgstr "一枚令人不安的小石头，面容仿佛不断变化。成功启动会开启蚀之刻并消耗一枚贝黑莱特。归途随之封闭；唯有在最终对决中活下来才能逃脱。"

#: dialogue/skull_knight.json
msgid "I found Judeau's knife hilt. What happened to the Band?"
msgstr "我找到了捷度的刀柄。鹰之团究竟怎么了？"

#: dialogue/skull_knight.json
msgid "Pippin held the line. Could anyone else have escaped?"
msgstr "彼宾守住了防线。还有其他人逃出来吗？"

#: dialogue/skull_knight.json
msgid "'He bought a few breaths for those who followed him. Do not let this place turn that choice into nothing.' The Skull Knight glances at the ruined hilt."
msgstr "“他为身后的人争取了片刻喘息。别让这个地方使他的选择化为乌有。”骷髅骑士望向破损的刀柄。"

#: dialogue/skull_knight.json
msgid "I will remember."
msgstr "我会记住。"

#: dialogue/skull_knight.json
msgid "'He stood where others would have fled. I cannot undo his death, but you can carry the memory of it beyond this field.'"
msgstr "“别人会逃离的地方，他却坚守不退。我无法改变他的死，但你可以把对他的记忆带出这片旷野。”"

#: dialogue/skull_knight.json
msgid "What should I do right now?"
msgstr "我现在该做什么？"

#: dialogue/skull_knight.json
msgid "What happened, and why did you save me?"
msgstr "发生了什么？你为什么救我？"

#: dialogue/skull_knight.json
msgid "What is the Brand, and why are nights dangerous?"
msgstr "烙印是什么？为什么夜晚如此危险？"

#: dialogue/skull_knight.json
msgid "How do apostles differ from the God Hand?"
msgstr "使徒和神之手有什么区别？"

#: dialogue/skull_knight.json
msgid "Why did the creature I fought before the Eclipse return?"
msgstr "为什么我在蚀之前战斗过的怪物又出现了？"

#: dialogue/skull_knight.json
msgid "What happened to my hand and eye?"
msgstr "我的手和眼睛怎么了？"

#: dialogue/skull_knight.json
msgid "Where do I go after I recover?"
msgstr "等我恢复之后该去哪里？"

#: dialogue/skull_knight.json
msgid "I have my answers. Farewell, Skull Knight."
msgstr "我已经得到答案了。再会，骷髅骑士。"

#: dialogue/skull_knight.json
msgid "Ask something else."
msgstr "再问点别的。"

#: dialogue/skull_knight.json
msgid "'Get clear of danger and tend your wounds. Rest in shelter; the Brand draws creatures after dark. The Berserker armor is no refuge while you recover. The recipes for the arm cannon and its charge are yours now.'"
msgstr "“离开险境，处理伤口。在掩体里休息；天黑后烙印会引来怪物。恢复期间，狂战士铠甲不是避难所。现在你已经掌握义肢炮和弹药的配方。”"

#: dialogue/skull_knight.json
msgid "'The Behelit opened the Eclipse, a place of sacrifice. I could not undo what happened there. I cut a path out while there was still someone left to save.'"
msgstr "“贝黑莱特开启了蚀，献祭之地。我无法抹去那里发生的一切。趁还有人可以救，我杀出了一条路。”"

#: dialogue/skull_knight.json
msgid "'The Brand marks a survivor of the sacrifice. Its pain warns you when demons draw near; a stronger presence hurts more. At night, expect them to seek you out. Find cover and leave yourself a way to flee.'"
msgstr "“烙印标记着献祭的幸存者。疼痛会警告你恶魔正在靠近；越强大的存在，痛得越厉害。夜里它们会追寻你。找好掩护，也给自己留一条退路。”"

#: dialogue/skull_knight.json
msgid "'Apostles are monstrous beings with wills and bodies of their own. The God Hand stand apart: they preside over the sacrifice. Void and Griffith are not ordinary apostles. Do not mistake surviving an encounter for defeating them.'"
msgstr "“使徒是拥有自身意志和肉体的怪物。神之手与他们不同：他们主持献祭。波伊德和格里菲斯不是普通使徒。别把从遭遇中幸存误认为击败了他们。”"

#: dialogue/skull_knight.json
msgid "'Some things you met before were projections: an echo formed around a Behelit. Breaking the echo leaves the true being untouched. The Behelit itself was real.'"
msgstr "“你先前遇到的一些存在只是投影：围绕贝黑莱特形成的回响。击碎回响不会伤及本体。贝黑莱特本身却是真的。”"

#: dialogue/skull_knight.json
msgid "'You lost your left hand and an eye in the Eclipse. The missing hand limits your grip; the lost eye narrows your perception. The Brand is another wound, and it will keep calling to the dark.'"
msgstr "“你在蚀中失去了左手和一只眼睛。失去手会削弱抓握，失去眼会削弱感知。烙印是另一道伤口，它会不断呼唤黑暗。”"

#: dialogue/skull_knight.json
msgid "'Survive the coming nights. Gather what you need to make the arm cannon; then decide which traces of the apostles to follow. There is no safe road laid out for you.'"
msgstr "“先活过接下来的几个夜晚。收集制作义肢炮的材料，然后决定追寻哪位使徒的踪迹。前方没有安全的路。”"

#: overmap/eclipse_expanded.json
msgid "Eclipse: arrival"
msgstr "蚀之刻：降临之地"

#: overmap/eclipse_expanded.json
msgid "Eclipse: fallen band"
msgstr "蚀之刻：战死的鹰之团"

#: overmap/eclipse_expanded.json
msgid "Eclipse: abandoned supplies"
msgstr "蚀之刻：遗弃的补给"

#: overmap/eclipse_expanded.json
msgid "Eclipse: torn field"
msgstr "蚀之刻：撕裂的战场"

#: overmap/eclipse_expanded.json
msgid "Eclipse: crossroads"
msgstr "蚀之刻：岔路"

#: overmap/eclipse_expanded.json
msgid "Eclipse: feast"
msgstr "蚀之刻：血肉盛宴"

#: overmap/eclipse_expanded.json
msgid "Eclipse: hunting ground"
msgstr "蚀之刻：狩猎场"

#: overmap/eclipse_expanded.json
msgid "Eclipse: scarred ravine"
msgstr "蚀之刻：伤痕峡谷"

#: overmap/eclipse_expanded.json
msgid "Eclipse: final approach"
msgstr "蚀之刻：最终通路"

#: overmap/eclipse_expanded.json
msgid "Eclipse: last stand"
msgstr "蚀之刻：最后的抵抗"

#: overmap/eclipse_expanded.json
msgid "Eclipse: ceremony threshold"
msgstr "蚀之刻：仪式门槛"

#: overmap/eclipse_expanded.json
msgid "Eclipse: ceremony"
msgstr "蚀之刻：仪式"

#: effects/eclipse_trial_eocs.json
msgid "An ashen trail leads east to the fallen band, then bends south toward the ceremony. Narrower tracks branch into the dark."
msgstr "覆灰的小径向东通往牺牲的鹰之团，随后向南弯向仪式。更窄的足迹延伸进黑暗。"

#: furniture/shelter_ward.json
msgid "bone and stone ward"
msgstr "骨石护符"

#: furniture/shelter_ward.json
msgid "A ring of bone and stone marked against the Brand of Sacrifice. It weakens the Brand's summons within eight tiles, but does nothing to demons already nearby or those roaming the world."
msgstr "以骨石围成的护符，刻有抵御祭品烙印的符记。八格以内可抑制烙印的召唤，但无法驱逐已在附近或游荡于世间的恶魔。"

#: overmap/first_hunt.json
msgid "apostle's hollow"
msgstr "使徒巢穴"

#: monsters/first_hunt_apostle.json
msgid "apostle of the hollow"
msgid_plural "apostles of the hollow"
msgstr[0] "巢穴使徒"

#: monsters/first_hunt_apostle.json
msgid "A lesser apostle rooted in a forest hollow. Its hooked arms drag prey into the bare earth. It strikes in short lunges but cannot recover from sustained wounds."
msgstr "盘踞在森林巢穴中的下位使徒。钩状双臂将猎物拖向裸露的土地。它能短距离突袭，却无法从持续的伤势中恢复。"

#: items/first_hunt_clue.json
msgid "apostle's burned scrap"
msgstr "使徒的焦纸"

#: items/first_hunt_clue.json
msgid "A charred scrap covered with routes between old breaches. The hollow's keeper carried it. Its markings suggest this was only one of several places where the worlds touch."
msgstr "一张画着古老裂隙间路线的焦纸，由巢穴的守护者携带。标记表明此处只是数个世界交汇之地中的一个。"

#: effects/first_hunt_eocs.json
msgid "The Brand burns as you remember the Skull Knight's warning. A forest hollow is marked on your map. An apostle waits there; build a ward and prepare before following its trail."
msgstr "烙印灼痛，令你想起骷髅骑士的警告。地图上标出了森林巢穴。使徒正等在那里；追踪之前，先建造护符并做好准备。"

#: effects/first_hunt_eocs.json
msgid "The apostle falls. Its burned scrap holds traces of other breaches; this hunt is over, but the path beyond it remains."
msgstr "使徒倒下了。它的焦纸上还留着其他裂隙的线索。这场狩猎结束了，前路仍在延伸。"

#: dialogue/skull_knight.json
msgid "'Tend your wounds and find a defensible shelter before nightfall. Build a bone and stone ward there: within eight tiles it quiets the Brand's summons, but wandering demons can still enter. The arm cannon and its charge can be crafted when you are ready.'"
msgstr "“处理伤口，在天黑前找到能守住的庇护所。在那里建造骨石护符：八格以内可以压制烙印的召唤，但游荡的恶魔仍可闯入。准备好之后再制作臂炮和弹药。”"

#: dialogue/skull_knight.json
msgid "'A lesser apostle has taken root in a forest hollow. Its location will be marked on your map. Build a ward, prepare your arm cannon if you can, and choose when to hunt it. Its remains may point toward the next breach.'"
msgstr "“一名下位使徒盘踞在森林巢穴。它的位置将标在你的地图上。先建造护符，如果可以，再备好臂炮，然后自行决定何时狩猎。它的遗物或许能指向下一个裂隙。”"

#: construction/shelter_ward.json
msgid "Build bone and stone ward"
msgstr "建造骨石护符"

#: items/first_hunt_clue.json
msgid "A charred scrap covered with routes between old breaches. The hollow's keeper carried it. Activate it after the first hunt to trace one nearby breach on your map."
msgstr "一张画着古老裂隙间路线的焦纸，由巢穴的守护者携带。完成首次狩猎后使用它，可在地图上找到附近的一处裂隙。"

#: items/first_hunt_clue.json
msgid "Follow the scorched trail"
msgstr "追寻焦灼的踪迹"

#: effects/first_hunt_eocs.json
msgid "The apostle falls. Search its remains for a burned scrap; activate the scrap to trace a nearby breach."
msgstr "使徒倒下了。搜索它的遗骸，找到焦纸并使用它，追查附近的裂隙。"

#: overmap/local_breach.json
msgid "ashen breach"
msgstr "灰烬裂隙"

#: furniture/local_breach.json
msgid "open breach"
msgstr "敞开的裂隙"

#: furniture/local_breach.json
msgid "The ground folds inward around a pulsing wound in the world. Defeat its guardian, then examine this place to close the breach."
msgstr "土地围绕着世界的伤口向内塌陷。击败守护者，然后调查此处以封闭裂隙。"

#: furniture/local_breach.json
msgid "sealed breach"
msgstr "封闭的裂隙"

#: furniture/local_breach.json
msgid "The wound in the world has hardened to black glass. New demonic incursions are weaker nearby; creatures already in the region remain."
msgstr "世界的伤口凝成黑色玻璃。附近新的恶魔侵袭减弱了，已经游荡在此的怪物仍然存在。"

#: monsters/breach_warden.json
msgid "breach warden"
msgid_plural "breach wardens"
msgstr[0] "裂隙守卫"

#: monsters/breach_warden.json
msgid "A heavy apostle bound to the wound in the forest. It guards the opening with deliberate blows. Beneath its armor of fused bone, nothing knits back together once broken."
msgstr "一名与森林伤口相连的沉重使徒。它以沉稳的重击守护裂隙。融合骨甲之下，破碎之处不会再生。"

#: items/post_eclipse_journal.json
msgid "journal of the first breach"
msgstr "第一处裂隙日志"

#: items/post_eclipse_journal.json
msgid "The burned scrap and the sealed wound explain two possible paths: defend a refuge and its people, or hunt the next apostle. Activate the journal to record your present intention. No further quest is unlocked yet."
msgstr "焦纸和封闭的伤口揭示了两条道路：守护庇护所和其中的人，或追猎下一名使徒。使用日志记录当前的决定。后续任务尚未开放。"

#: items/post_eclipse_journal.json
msgid "Consider the next path"
msgstr "思考下一步"

#: effects/local_breach_eocs.json
msgid "The ashen breach is already marked on your map."
msgstr "灰烬裂隙已经标在地图上。"

#: effects/local_breach_eocs.json
msgid "The scorched routes make sense only after you survive the Eclipse and the first hunt. Read them above ground."
msgstr "只有经历日蚀与首次狩猎之后，焦灼的路线才有意义。请在地表查看。"

#: effects/local_breach_eocs.json
msgid "You follow the burned lines to an ashen breach marked on your map. Its guardian holds the opening; defeating it may let you close the wound."
msgstr "你循着焦纸上的线索，在地图上标出一处灰烬裂隙。守护者维持着裂口；击败它或许就能封闭伤口。"

#: effects/local_breach_eocs.json
msgid "You cannot locate the breach from here. Travel farther and consult the scrap again."
msgstr "无法从这里找到裂隙。请走得更远，再查看焦纸。"

#: effects/local_breach_eocs.json
msgid "The guardian collapses. The breach is exposed; examine its center to seal it."
msgstr "守护者倒下了。裂隙暴露出来；调查中心即可将其封闭。"

#: effects/local_breach_eocs.json
msgid "The wound turns to dark glass. New incursions weaken around this breach, but the demons already loose remain. A journal records what you have learned; choose your next path when ready."
msgstr "伤口化作暗色玻璃。附近新的侵袭减弱了，但已经出现的恶魔仍然游荡。日志记下了所知的一切；准备好后再选择下一条道路。"

#: effects/local_breach_eocs.json
msgid "The breach cannot be closed while its guardian lives. Defeat it and return to the center."
msgstr "守护者还活着，裂隙就无法关闭。击败它后返回中心。"

#: effects/local_breach_eocs.json
msgid "Record a promise to defend a refuge and its people?"
msgstr "记录守护庇护所和人们的誓言？"

#: effects/local_breach_eocs.json
msgid "You choose to protect a refuge and those who reach it. The journal keeps this intention for a future chapter."
msgstr "你选择守护庇护所和到达那里的人们。日志会为未来的篇章保存这个决定。"

#: effects/local_breach_eocs.json
msgid "Record a vow to pursue the next apostle instead?"
msgstr "记录追猎下一名使徒的誓言？"

#: effects/local_breach_eocs.json
msgid "You choose to follow the next apostle's trail. The journal keeps this intention for a future chapter."
msgstr "你选择追寻下一名使徒的踪迹。日志会为未来的篇章保存这个决定。"

#: effects/local_breach_eocs.json
msgid "You close the journal without changing your path."
msgstr "你合上日志，没有改变所选的道路。"

#: effects/local_breach_eocs.json
msgid "The journal has no ending to record until the local breach is sealed."
msgstr "当地裂隙尚未封闭，日志暂时没有结局可记录。"

#: effects/behelit_reward_eocs.json effects/behelit_site_eocs.json furniture/behelit_sites.json overmap/behelit_sites.json monsters/apostle_projections.json
msgid "You recover a Behelit from the hiding place. The empty recess holds nothing else."
msgstr "你从藏处取出贝黑莱特。空荡的凹槽中再无其他东西。"

#: effects/behelit_reward_eocs.json effects/behelit_site_eocs.json furniture/behelit_sites.json overmap/behelit_sites.json monsters/apostle_projections.json
msgid "The guardian is too close to the hiding place. Defeat it or lure it away before taking the Behelit."
msgstr "守卫离藏处太近了。先击败它或将它引开，再取走贝黑莱特。"

#: effects/behelit_reward_eocs.json effects/behelit_site_eocs.json furniture/behelit_sites.json overmap/behelit_sites.json monsters/apostle_projections.json
msgid "The hiding place has fallen silent. Your passage into the Eclipse has already been used; no Behelit remains here."
msgstr "藏处已经沉寂。你已使用过通往蚀之刻的道路；这里不再有贝黑莱特。"

#: effects/behelit_reward_eocs.json effects/behelit_site_eocs.json furniture/behelit_sites.json overmap/behelit_sites.json monsters/apostle_projections.json
msgid "You cannot open the hiding place. Nothing has been taken; you can try again."
msgstr "你无法打开藏处。你尚未取走任何东西，可以再试一次。"

#: effects/behelit_reward_eocs.json effects/behelit_site_eocs.json furniture/behelit_sites.json overmap/behelit_sites.json monsters/apostle_projections.json
msgid "The %s unravels."
msgstr "%s消散了。"

#: effects/behelit_reward_eocs.json effects/behelit_site_eocs.json furniture/behelit_sites.json overmap/behelit_sites.json monsters/apostle_projections.json
msgid "The cracked bell tolls across the ruined chapel!"
msgstr "开裂的钟声响彻破败的礼拜堂！"

#: effects/behelit_reward_eocs.json effects/behelit_site_eocs.json furniture/behelit_sites.json overmap/behelit_sites.json monsters/apostle_projections.json
msgid "The bell can draw the chapel's guardian south. The broken west wall offers another route to the reliquary."
msgstr "钟声可以将礼拜堂的守卫引向南方。西墙的缺口提供了另一条通往圣物匣的道路。"

#: effects/behelit_reward_eocs.json effects/behelit_site_eocs.json furniture/behelit_sites.json overmap/behelit_sites.json monsters/apostle_projections.json
msgid "An emergency siren howls through the abandoned camp!"
msgstr "紧急警报声响彻废弃的营地！"

#: effects/behelit_reward_eocs.json effects/behelit_site_eocs.json furniture/behelit_sites.json overmap/behelit_sites.json monsters/apostle_projections.json
msgid "The siren draws attention to the edge of camp. Circle around the ruined shelters to reach the specimen case."
msgstr "警报将注意力引向营地边缘。绕过破败的营舍，就能接近样本箱。"

#: effects/behelit_reward_eocs.json effects/behelit_site_eocs.json furniture/behelit_sites.json overmap/behelit_sites.json monsters/apostle_projections.json
msgid "desecrated chapel"
msgstr "被亵渎的礼拜堂"

#: effects/behelit_reward_eocs.json effects/behelit_site_eocs.json furniture/behelit_sites.json overmap/behelit_sites.json monsters/apostle_projections.json
msgid "desecrated chapel reliquary"
msgstr "被亵渎的礼拜堂圣物室"

#: effects/behelit_reward_eocs.json effects/behelit_site_eocs.json furniture/behelit_sites.json overmap/behelit_sites.json monsters/apostle_projections.json
msgid "lost expedition camp"
msgstr "失踪探险队营地"

#: effects/behelit_reward_eocs.json effects/behelit_site_eocs.json furniture/behelit_sites.json overmap/behelit_sites.json monsters/apostle_projections.json
msgid "sealed chapel reliquary"
msgstr "封闭的礼拜堂圣物匣"

#: effects/behelit_reward_eocs.json effects/behelit_site_eocs.json furniture/behelit_sites.json overmap/behelit_sites.json monsters/apostle_projections.json
msgid "A red stone face rests inside a cracked reliquary. The butcher guards the approach. Examine the case after defeating or distracting it."
msgstr "一张红色石面孔躺在开裂的圣物匣中。屠夫守着通路。击败或引开它后再检查匣子。"

#: effects/behelit_reward_eocs.json effects/behelit_site_eocs.json furniture/behelit_sites.json overmap/behelit_sites.json monsters/apostle_projections.json
msgid "silent chapel reliquary"
msgstr "沉寂的礼拜堂圣物匣"

#: effects/behelit_reward_eocs.json effects/behelit_site_eocs.json furniture/behelit_sites.json overmap/behelit_sites.json monsters/apostle_projections.json
msgid "The broken reliquary holds only dust. It will yield no Behelit."
msgstr "破损的圣物匣中只剩尘土，不会再出现贝黑莱特。"

#: effects/behelit_reward_eocs.json effects/behelit_site_eocs.json furniture/behelit_sites.json overmap/behelit_sites.json monsters/apostle_projections.json
msgid "cracked chapel bell"
msgstr "开裂的礼拜堂钟"

#: effects/behelit_reward_eocs.json effects/behelit_site_eocs.json furniture/behelit_sites.json overmap/behelit_sites.json monsters/apostle_projections.json
msgid "The fallen bell still hangs from a timber frame. Examine it to draw attention away from the northern reliquary."
msgstr "旧钟仍挂在木架上。检查它，将注意力从北面的圣物室引开。"

#: effects/behelit_reward_eocs.json effects/behelit_site_eocs.json furniture/behelit_sites.json overmap/behelit_sites.json monsters/apostle_projections.json
msgid "chapel inscription"
msgstr "礼拜堂碑文"

#: effects/behelit_reward_eocs.json effects/behelit_site_eocs.json furniture/behelit_sites.json overmap/behelit_sites.json monsters/apostle_projections.json
msgid "Scratched words cover a stone near the entrance. Examine them to learn what lies farther north."
msgstr "入口附近的石头上刻着文字。检查它，了解北面藏着什么。"

#: effects/behelit_reward_eocs.json effects/behelit_site_eocs.json furniture/behelit_sites.json overmap/behelit_sites.json monsters/apostle_projections.json
msgid "sealed expedition specimen case"
msgstr "封闭的探险队样本箱"

#: effects/behelit_reward_eocs.json effects/behelit_site_eocs.json furniture/behelit_sites.json overmap/behelit_sites.json monsters/apostle_projections.json
msgid "A stone with a human face rests inside a battered specimen case. A half-demon prowls nearby. Examine the case when it cannot reach you."
msgstr "一块长着人脸的石头躺在破旧的样本箱里。半恶魔在附近徘徊。等它无法接近你时再检查箱子。"

#: effects/behelit_reward_eocs.json effects/behelit_site_eocs.json furniture/behelit_sites.json overmap/behelit_sites.json monsters/apostle_projections.json
msgid "empty expedition specimen case"
msgstr "空的探险队样本箱"

#: effects/behelit_reward_eocs.json effects/behelit_site_eocs.json furniture/behelit_sites.json overmap/behelit_sites.json monsters/apostle_projections.json
msgid "The specimen case holds nothing but torn packing material. It will yield no Behelit."
msgstr "样本箱中只剩破碎的包装材料，不会再出现贝黑莱特。"

#: effects/behelit_reward_eocs.json effects/behelit_site_eocs.json furniture/behelit_sites.json overmap/behelit_sites.json monsters/apostle_projections.json
msgid "wind-up emergency siren"
msgstr "手摇紧急警报器"

#: effects/behelit_reward_eocs.json effects/behelit_site_eocs.json furniture/behelit_sites.json overmap/behelit_sites.json monsters/apostle_projections.json
msgid "A hand-cranked siren lies at the southern edge of camp. Examine it to distract the creature guarding the specimen shelter."
msgstr "一台手摇警报器放在营地南缘。检查它，引开守着样本营舍的生物。"

#: effects/behelit_reward_eocs.json effects/behelit_site_eocs.json furniture/behelit_sites.json overmap/behelit_sites.json monsters/apostle_projections.json
msgid "expedition field log"
msgstr "探险队野外日志"

#: effects/behelit_reward_eocs.json effects/behelit_site_eocs.json furniture/behelit_sites.json overmap/behelit_sites.json monsters/apostle_projections.json
msgid "Water-stained pages remain pinned to the camp table. Examine them for the expedition's final observations."
msgstr "营地桌上钉着被水浸过的纸页。检查它们，阅读探险队最后的观察记录。"

#: effects/behelit_reward_eocs.json effects/behelit_site_eocs.json furniture/behelit_sites.json overmap/behelit_sites.json monsters/apostle_projections.json
msgid "The inscription reads: \"We hid the red stone in the northern reliquary. The thing that followed it cannot resist the bell. Circle through the broken west wall while it searches the nave.\""
msgstr "碑文写道：“我们把红石藏在北面的圣物室。追着它来的东西会被钟声吸引。趁它在主厅搜索时，从西墙缺口绕过去。”"

#: effects/behelit_reward_eocs.json effects/behelit_site_eocs.json furniture/behelit_sites.json overmap/behelit_sites.json monsters/apostle_projections.json
msgid "The final entry reads: \"Specimen: a red stone face, secured in the northeastern shelter. A human-shaped predator keeps returning to it. Use the hand-cranked siren to draw it south, then approach through the gaps between the shelters.\""
msgstr "最后一条记录写道：“样本：红色石面孔，存放于东北方营舍。一个人形捕食者不断返回那里。用手摇警报器将它引向南方，再从营舍之间的空隙接近。”"

#. New Horizon: independent Count hunt and expanded echo cave
msgid "The Count's breach hardens into cold stone. New incursions weaken within roughly two overmap tiles of this place. The Brand and the demons already here remain."
msgstr "伯爵的裂口凝成冰冷的石头。此地约两格大地图范围内的新入侵减弱。烙印和已经出现的恶魔仍然存在。"

#. New Horizon: independent Count hunt and expanded echo cave
msgid "The Count's residence is marked on your map. His servants patrol the grounds; the apostle waits below the execution hall."
msgstr "伯爵的宅邸已标在地图上。他的仆从巡视庭院；使徒在行刑大厅下方等待。"

#. New Horizon: independent Count hunt and expanded echo cave
msgid "Follow this trail above ground after surviving the Eclipse and completing the first hunt."
msgstr "在幸存于蚀并完成第一次狩猎后，到地面上追寻这条线索。"

#. New Horizon: independent Count hunt and expanded echo cave
msgid "A trail of executions leads to the Count's fortified residence, now marked on your map. Explore the grounds before descending. His servants are mortal; no endless reinforcements will replace them."
msgstr "行刑的线索通向伯爵的设防宅邸，现已标在地图上。下去之前先侦察庭院。他的仆从会死，不会有无穷无尽的援军。"

#. New Horizon: independent Count hunt and expanded echo cave
msgid "No suitable residence could be located nearby. Travel elsewhere and consult the hunt journal or the Skull Knight again."
msgstr "附近未能找到合适的宅邸。去别处，再查阅狩猎日记或询问骷髅骑士。"

#. New Horizon: independent Count hunt and expanded echo cave
msgid "The Count is dead. His broken iron seal remains among his spoils. Examine the exposed breach at the north end of the dungeon to close this local wound."
msgstr "伯爵已死。他的战利品中留下破碎的铁印。检查地牢北端暴露的裂口，封闭这道局部伤口。"

#. New Horizon: independent Count hunt and expanded echo cave
msgid "The breach is still held by the Count. Defeat him before examining it again."
msgstr "伯爵仍控制着裂口。击败他后再来检查。"

#. New Horizon: independent Count hunt and expanded echo cave
msgid "The opening resisted the seal. Step away from its center and examine it again; the hunt has not been marked complete."
msgstr "裂口未能封闭。离开其中心再检查一次；狩猎尚未标记为完成。"

#. New Horizon: independent Count hunt and expanded echo cave
msgid "The stone records an execution list. A different hand scratched beneath it: \"The thing below us made his servants from men. Clear the yard; there are passages through both wings. The stairs lie in the northeastern hall. Leave room to evade his heavy body.\""
msgstr "石上刻着处决名单。下方另一只手划写道：“下面的怪物把人变成仆从。清理庭院；两翼都有通路。楼梯在东北大厅。留出空间躲避他沉重的身体。”"

#. New Horizon: independent Count hunt and expanded echo cave
msgid "The Count's shattered iron seal is proof of your hunt. Closing his exposed breach quiets future incursions near his residence, but does not erase the Brand. Other apostles must be hunted separately. This trophy grants no damage or Berserk-duration bonus."
msgstr "伯爵破碎的铁印是狩猎的凭证。封闭其裂口可减弱宅邸附近的未来入侵，但不会抹去烙印。其他使徒必须分别狩猎。此战利品不提供伤害或狂战士持续时间加成。"

#. New Horizon: independent Count hunt and expanded echo cave
msgid "You choose to pursue the next apostle. The journal now traces the Count's residence; you can return to this trail even if the Skull Knight has departed."
msgstr "你决定追寻下一个使徒。日记现在指向伯爵的宅邸；即使骷髅骑士已离开，你仍能再次追寻此线索。"

#. New Horizon: independent Count hunt and expanded echo cave
msgid "The first sealed breach opened two possible paths. Activate this journal to consider protecting a refuge or to trace the Count's residence. His hunt has its own record and local breach."
msgstr "第一个封闭的裂口开启两条道路。使用此日记，考虑守护庇护所或追踪伯爵的宅邸。这次狩猎及其局部裂口有独立记录。"

#. New Horizon: independent Count hunt and expanded echo cave
msgid "Preparing a body sweep"
msgstr "准备横扫"

#. New Horizon: independent Count hunt and expanded echo cave
msgid "The Count is drawing back his massive body for a sweeping blow. Move out of reach."
msgstr "伯爵收回巨大的身体，准备横扫。离开他的攻击范围。"

#. New Horizon: independent Count hunt and expanded echo cave
msgid "The Count coils his enormous body for a crushing sweep!"
msgstr "伯爵蜷起庞大的身体，准备粉碎性的横扫！"

#. New Horizon: independent Count hunt and expanded echo cave
msgid "The Count smashes his massive body into you!"
msgstr "伯爵巨大的身体撞上了你！"

#. New Horizon: independent Count hunt and expanded echo cave
msgid "The Count smashes his massive body into %s!"
msgstr "伯爵巨大的身体撞上了%s！"

#. New Horizon: independent Count hunt and expanded echo cave
msgid "The Count's heavy body sweeps past you!"
msgstr "伯爵沉重的身体从你身旁扫过！"

#. New Horizon: independent Count hunt and expanded echo cave
msgid "The Count's heavy body sweeps past %s!"
msgstr "伯爵沉重的身体从%s身旁扫过！"

#. New Horizon: independent Count hunt and expanded echo cave
msgid "Counts"
msgstr "伯爵"

#. New Horizon: independent Count hunt and expanded echo cave
msgid "The Count, an apostle whose swollen, slug-like body fills the dungeon. He ruled through executions and twisted servants. His weight makes every close blow dangerous, but he turns slowly and his wounds do not regenerate. When he coils his body, leave room to evade the sweep."
msgstr "伯爵，使徒肿胀的蛞蝓般身躯占据地牢。他以处决和扭曲的仆从统治。沉重的身体让每次近身打击都很危险，但他行动迟缓，伤口不会再生。他蜷起身体时，要留出躲避横扫的空间。"

#. New Horizon: independent Count hunt and expanded echo cave
msgid "the Count's twisted servants"
msgstr "伯爵的扭曲仆从"

#. New Horizon: independent Count hunt and expanded echo cave
msgid "A human servant remade with the Count's flesh. A second jaw splits its chest, but beneath the deformity its body is still vulnerable. This servant will not be replaced when killed."
msgstr "被伯爵的血肉改造的人类仆从。第二张嘴裂开胸膛，但畸形之下的身体依然脆弱。它死后不会有新的仆从补位。"

#. New Horizon: independent Count hunt and expanded echo cave
msgid "survivor of the Count's prison"
msgstr "伯爵监牢的幸存者"

#. New Horizon: independent Count hunt and expanded echo cave
msgid "An unnamed prisoner hiding in the abandoned western wing. They know the passage to the execution hall and will speak if you approach. This encounter is an adaptation, not a named character from the manga."
msgstr "一名无名囚徒躲在废弃的西翼。他知道通往行刑大厅的通道，靠近后可以交谈。这场遭遇是改编内容，并非漫画中的具名角色。"

#. New Horizon: independent Count hunt and expanded echo cave
msgid "the Count's shattered iron seal"
msgstr "伯爵破碎的铁印"

#. New Horizon: independent Count hunt and expanded echo cave
msgid "A heavy seal torn from the Count's remains. Keep it as proof of the hunt. Activate it to recall how to close his local breach. It is a trophy, not a universal crystal upgrade."
msgstr "从伯爵遗骸中取出的沉重铁印。保留它作为狩猎凭证。使用可回顾如何封闭他的局部裂口。这是战利品，并非万能升级水晶。"

#. New Horizon: independent Count hunt and expanded echo cave
msgid "Recall the Count's breach"
msgstr "回顾伯爵的裂口"

#. New Horizon: independent Count hunt and expanded echo cave
msgid "\"Keep your voice down. I hid here when the Count remade the others. I can show you where he waits, but I will not go back down there.\""
msgstr "“小声些。伯爵改造其他人时，我躲到了这里。我能告诉你他在哪，但不会再下去。”"

#. New Horizon: independent Count hunt and expanded echo cave
msgid "How do I reach him?"
msgstr "怎么找到他？"

#. New Horizon: independent Count hunt and expanded echo cave
msgid "What are his servants?"
msgstr "他的仆从是什么？"

#. New Horizon: independent Count hunt and expanded echo cave
msgid "He is dead. What about the opening below?"
msgstr "他死了。下面的裂口怎么办？"

#. New Horizon: independent Count hunt and expanded echo cave
msgid "Stay here. I will look around."
msgstr "留在这里。我去看看。"

#. New Horizon: independent Count hunt and expanded echo cave
msgid "\"The execution hall is in the northeast. The stairs go down from its center. Both wings lead there; the broken western wall gives you another way around the yard. The pillars below will break his line of sight, but do not let his body pin you against them.\""
msgstr "“行刑大厅在东北，楼梯在大厅中央。两翼都通向那里；西墙缺口能绕过庭院。下面的柱子能挡住视线，但别让他把你压在柱子上。”"

#. New Horizon: independent Count hunt and expanded echo cave
msgid "\"They were people. He forced his own flesh into them. There are only a few left here. Kill them separately if you must; they will not return, and he cannot call an endless army.\""
msgstr "“他们曾经是人。他强行把自己的血肉塞进他们体内。这里只有几个了。必要时逐个消灭；他们不会回来，他也召不出无穷大军。”"

#. New Horizon: independent Count hunt and expanded echo cave
msgid "\"The exposed stone at the north end feeds this place. Examine it now that he cannot hold it open. It should quiet new incursions nearby. It will not undo your Brand or kill the things already outside.\""
msgstr "“北端暴露的石头为这里提供力量。现在他无法维持裂口，去检查它。附近的新入侵应该会减弱。但它不会消除烙印，也不会杀死已经出来的东西。”"

#. New Horizon: independent Count hunt and expanded echo cave
msgid "I survived the first hunt. Show me the Count's trail."
msgstr "我活过了第一次狩猎。告诉我伯爵的线索。"

#. New Horizon: independent Count hunt and expanded echo cave
msgid "\"The Count is no projection. His fortified residence shelters men he remade with his flesh. Explore the wings, clear the servants, then descend beneath the northeastern execution hall. His death exposes one local wound; each apostle and each breach must be answered separately.\""
msgstr "“伯爵不是投影。他的设防宅邸里藏着被他血肉改造的人。探索两翼，清除仆从，再下到东北行刑大厅下方。他死后会暴露一道局部伤口；每个使徒、每道裂口都必须分别解决。”"

#. New Horizon: independent Count hunt and expanded echo cave
msgid "the Count's exposed breach"
msgstr "伯爵暴露的裂口"

#. New Horizon: independent Count hunt and expanded echo cave
msgid "A raw seam in the northern stone. Examine it after killing the Count to weaken future incursions around this residence."
msgstr "北侧石中的鲜红裂缝。杀死伯爵后检查它，可减弱宅邸周围的未来入侵。"

#. New Horizon: independent Count hunt and expanded echo cave
msgid "the Count's execution record"
msgstr "伯爵的处决记录"

#. New Horizon: independent Count hunt and expanded echo cave
msgid "Names and a scratched warning. Examine the record before descending into the dungeon."
msgstr "姓名和刻下的警告。下地牢前检查记录。"

#. New Horizon: independent Count hunt and expanded echo cave
msgid "the Count's sealed breach"
msgstr "伯爵封闭的裂口"

#. New Horizon: independent Count hunt and expanded echo cave
msgid "The Count's wound has closed. Its nearby influence is recorded in the world; existing demons remain."
msgstr "伯爵的伤口已闭合。附近影响的减弱已记录在世界中；已经出现的恶魔仍在。"

#. New Horizon: independent Count hunt and expanded echo cave
msgid "the Count's western prison"
msgstr "伯爵的西侧监牢"

#. New Horizon: independent Count hunt and expanded echo cave
msgid "the Count's execution hall"
msgstr "伯爵的行刑大厅"

#. New Horizon: independent Count hunt and expanded echo cave
msgid "the Count's west courtyard"
msgstr "伯爵的西庭院"

#. New Horizon: independent Count hunt and expanded echo cave
msgid "the Count's east courtyard"
msgstr "伯爵的东庭院"

#. New Horizon: independent Count hunt and expanded echo cave
msgid "the Count's dungeon"
msgstr "伯爵的地牢"

#. New Horizon: independent Count hunt and expanded echo cave
msgid "echo cave gallery"
msgstr "回响洞穴长廊"

#. New Horizon: independent Count hunt and expanded echo cave
msgid "echo cave winding passage"
msgstr "回响洞穴曲折通道"

#. New Horizon: independent Count hunt and expanded echo cave
msgid "echo cave relic chamber"
msgstr "回响洞穴遗物室"

#. New Horizon: independent Count hunt and expanded echo cave
msgid "A stone chime hangs beside the winding western passage. Stand next to it and examine it to make a loud echo. Break the keeper's line of sight first: noise cannot force it to ignore visible prey."
msgstr "石钟挂在曲折的西侧通道旁。站在旁边检查它，制造响亮回声。先避开守卫的视线：噪声不能迫使它忽视看得见的猎物。"

#. New Horizon: independent Count hunt and expanded echo cave
msgid "The stone chime rings out. Use the winding galleries to break line of sight and approach the eastern relic chamber by the other route."
msgstr "石钟响起。利用曲折的长廊避开视线，从另一条路线靠近东侧遗物室。"


#. New Horizon monster plural
msgid "the Count"
msgid_plural "Counts"
msgstr[0] "伯爵"


#. New Horizon monster plural
msgid "the Count's twisted servant"
msgid_plural "the Count's twisted servants"
msgstr[0] "伯爵的扭曲仆从"
